ce concerning the Call for Applications only </div>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"d-flex\">\n                                            <p b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">\n                                                <a b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"list-item\" href=\"mailto:assistenza.studyinitaly@esteri.it\" target=\"_blank\"> assistenza.studyinitaly@esteri.it </a>\n                                            </p>\n                                            <div b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"mx-2\"> for technical support only </div>\n                                             \n                                        </li>\n                                        <li b-3wq0a7r37g>\n                                            <p b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">\n                                                <a b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"list-item\" href=\"https://www.esteri.it/it/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Sito ufficiale Ministero Affari Esteri\"> www.esteri.it </a>\n                                            </p>\n                                        </li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </blockquote>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 pb-2\">\n                            <h4 b-3wq0a7r37g><a href=\"/Home/Privacy\"> Privacy </a></h4>\n                            <div b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"link-list-wrapper\">\n                                <hr b-3wq0a7r37g>\n                                <blockquote b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"blockquote\">\n                                    <p b-3wq0a7r37g class=\"mb-0\">\n                                        For further information about privacy policy <a class=\"text-white fw-bold\" href=\"/Home/Privacy\"> click here </a>\n                                    </p>\n                                </blo